{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"tunde-adebimpe","name":"Tunde Adebimpe","birthDate":"1975-02-25","birthPlace":"St. Louis, Missouri, USA","bio":"Babatunde Omoroga Adebimpe (born February 25, 1975) is an American musician, singer, songwriter, and actor. He is best known as a founding member and co-lead vocalist of the Brooklyn-based band TV on the Radio, with whom he has recorded five studio albums. In April 2025, Adebimpe released his debut solo album, Thee Black Boltz.\n\nAs an actor, Adebimpe has appeared in the films Twisters, Spider-Man: Homecoming, Marriage Story and Rachel Getting Married, in addition to several independent feature films. He appeared in the 2024 science fiction television series Star Wars: Skeleton Crew, and provided voice acting on the animated series Strange Planet, Lazor Wolf, Pantheon, and Tuca & Bertie.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Tunde Adebimpe, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:22:20+00:00","tmdbId":94476,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/94476","credits":[{"id":"spider-home","title":"Spider-Man: Homecoming","character":"Mr. Cobbwell"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/tunde-adebimpe.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Twisters","year":2024,"character":"Dexter","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pjnD08FlMAIXsfOLKQbvmO0f0MD.jpg"},{"name":"I Dreamed of Seeing Myself","year":2024,"character":"Self (Voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kKifGKJTV3uVXAPNluLcm4mVCoy.jpg"},{"name":"Star Wars: Skeleton Crew","year":2024,"character":"Wendle","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/srQbJhLRKoAwRrNN5ga7webPHbC.jpg"},{"name":"Star Wars: Skeleton Crew","year":2024,"character":"Wendell","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/srQbJhLRKoAwRrNN5ga7webPHbC.jpg"},{"name":"The Heart","year":2023,"character":"Joshua","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.t